2026-10-20: Every conclusion below has no escape disjunct; inspected expanded predicates as well as surface syntax. Conjunctions require every conjunct. Representation equations and constructor inequalities are structural laws, explicitly identified, not claimed empirical discoveries. False premises, empty domains/tests and zero horizons are permitted special cases; the general statements also cover inhabited domains, nonempty tests and positive horizons. Refines requires an initial related pair, so the empty relation cannot witness refinement.
P5 namespace Nanodregg.Lang.Contextual.P5:
- checkRefutation_sound: coverage plus exclusion replay derives a universal negative over the declared domain; the conclusion is not the coverage premise repeated.
- witnessed_sound: actual judge execution implies membership AND acceptance; no witness-validity hypothesis assumes those facts.
- refuted_sound: actual refuted branch forces the checked certificate; retained-list exhaustion alone cannot discharge the conclusion.
- no_certificate_never_refuted: structural algorithm exclusion, for arbitrary domain/search/limit; no claim that a completion exists.
- exhausted_is_open: branch policy computed from search exhaustion; distinct from a satisfiability theorem.
- refuted_ne_outside: constructor inequality, intentionally structural; does not certify arbitrary payloads.
- not_unfilled_suspends: missing input forces negated evaluation to suspend, not true; changed expression in conclusion.
- negation_preserves_suspension: suspension of a subexpression survives a negation; semantic propagation, not P implies P.
- refines_refl: identity relation satisfies both transition obligations; intended algebraic law.
- refines_trans: composes two relations with an intermediate state and both successor obligations; requested composite absent from assumptions.
- simulation_receives: arbitrary legal nonempty input trace yields an implementation trace AND related endpoint; empty trace is only the induction base.
- narrowing_breaks_peer: concrete legal spec input refused by implementation contradicts every pointed relation.
- polarized_matching: both polarity directions required; a transparent bridge to LANG-67 labels, not an independent causality claim.
- simulation_preserves_safety: mixed input/output steps preserve refusal safety by induction for every finite horizon; zero case is True, positive cases require both directions. No progress claim.
- price_refines: cap increase and output inclusion produce stateful simulation for both idle/pending states. Empty output lists do not weaken the claimed safety-only contract.
- price_seven_breaks: closed computation of successful spec reception and failed replacement reception; both observations required.
- price_seven_not_refinement: closed negative excludes every possible relation via the legal input seven.
- price_reply_expansion_not_refinement: closed negative excludes every relation by the extra false reply at a pending state.
- four_status_session: decide evaluates four concrete requests, including open then witnessed for the same question, followed by explicit changed questions. Exact status/evidence sequence required.
- incomplete_certificate_refused: concrete positive-domain candidate missing from coverage prevents refutation.
- positive_candidate_refutes_certificate: full coverage containing an accepted candidate fails exclusion replay.
- out_of_domain_witness_refused: retained accepted candidate outside the declared domain cannot witness it.
- uniform_coin_problem_refuted: concrete two-candidate finite question evaluates both peer outcomes; distinct from the all-substitution theorem in P1.
P1 namespace Nanodregg.Lang.Contextual.P1:
- eligible_iff: Boolean/Prop representation equivalence; no renamed empirical guarantee.
- adding_obligation: exact intersection equivalence, requiring old eligibility AND the additional test; not merely monotonicity.
- required_implies_tested: universal restriction along test inclusion; intended antitone law, no converse claimed.
- eligible_antitone: preserves admission as well as restricted orthogonality; direct lifting of the preceding structural law.
- inspect_witnessed: successful execution entails complete input identity, admission and every returned interaction passing; not a premise about a fabricated report.
- analyze_witnessed: successful search entails domain membership, admission and every returned interaction passing.
- analyze_refuted: checked search excludes every accepted member of the explicit domain; no quantification over all possible fillings is implied.
- analyze_no_certificate: structural exclusion of refuted without a certificate; leaves open questions even with no witness.
- gaveUp_never_verified: structural inspect refusal, despite arbitrary tests/admissibility; no generic fabricated-status assertion.
- daimon_distinction: conjunction of intentionally universal behavioral compatibility and a non-successful gaveUp judgment; the first conjunct cannot discharge the second.
- singleton_judge: full equality of old/new judge results, including refusals; conservative representation theorem.
- interaction_judge_verified_iff: exact characterization retains typing, tests, blockers, supports and budget. Tests alone do not establish verification.
- judgeAt_verified_iff: same characterization with family selected by hole and world. No locality claim for arbitrary world dependencies.
- Nullable.tested_can_miss_required: concrete inspected handler passes non-null but fails null, and exact distinct scopes are retained; all four conjuncts required.
- Nullable.withdrawal_suspends: actual Session.run computes verified before withdrawal, conflict plus refill afterward, retaining selected index.
- Nullable.withdrawal_tolerated: real propose/select session repairs with tolerant handler and retains the old conflict.
- Nullable.withdrawal_checked: real propose/select session repairs with checking handler; its null reply is distinct from tolerance in the handler definition.
- Nullable.explicit_reprecondition: explicit setEnv true restores the precondition before reselection; no proof of external non-nullness invented.
- Nullable.inadmissible_filling_refused: concrete admission rejection despite successful non-null behavior.
- Nullable.daimon_empty_tests_still_open: concrete empty-test case remains open gaveUp, never a witness.
- Nullable.unretained_repair_exists: same question computes open for unchecked-only search and witness for tolerant-only search; conjunction demonstrates retained-search incompleteness.
- coin_interaction_obstruction: both interactions imply the landed all-substitution no-foresight contradiction. Uniform substitution is universally quantified, not restricted to the finite P5 probe.

