5. Re-establish the destination and the next concrete joins.
   Mini grows into Dregg; Bend is the central authored language, Nock compatibility.
   Native/oblivious/zkVM/specialized circuits/FHE are active construction directions.
   Traffic privacy and agreement are Oct13 conditions; full OO/private execution
   prototypes, substantial docuverse/deos and the inhabited world remain real work.
   First passing tranches are intermediate. Shared semantics and actual user
   experiences matter. No repository rename, paid calls or unrelated service
